[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0010","text":"呐～，小糸酱"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0020","text":"……诶，什、什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0030","text":"猫呢～……虽然经常被说很任性～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0040","text":"但也有不是那样的猫呢～\n大概"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0050","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0060","text":"不过，光想也想不明白呢～\n雏菜又不是猫～～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0070","text":"是、是这样呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0080","text":"………………\n────那、我去查查看……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0090","text":"诶～～～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_01_0100","text":"有没有呢～\n不任性的猫"}]
